<title>POLAND: PLI SEES NO 1996 DIVIDEND PAYOUT.</title>
<headline>PLI SEES NO 1996 DIVIDEND PAYOUT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading company Polish Life Improvement SA (PLI) wants to allot all of its 8.17 million zlotys net profit for last year to boost reserve capital, the company said in a statement on Wednedsay.</p>
<p>The final decision will be taken at the general shareholders meeting on May 28, it said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
